ESP32 Swarm Robot Code – Project Description
The project entails the development of an efficient small-scale swarm robotics system utilizing ESP32 microcontrollers. The robots are designed to perform autonomously while interacting with other robots via wireless communication.
Main features:
Autonomous Navigation: The robots are capable of autonomous movement and obstacle avoidance with the help of sensors.
Swarm Coordination: The robots are capable of coordinating with other robots and performing various actions with the help of wireless communication.
Modular and Reusable Code: The code is designed in such a way that more functions and operations can be integrated into the system.
Real-time Decision-Making: The robots are capable of making decisions in real time with the help of sensors and other robots.